]},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7da2-832e-aeb4111fa88a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual organiza\u00e7\u00e3o de direitos dos animais \u00e9 conhecida por suas campanhas contra os testes em animais e o consumo de carne?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"PETA significa People for the Ethical Treatment of Animals (Pessoas pelo Tratamento \u00c9tico dos Animais). Suas campanhas tamb\u00e9m abordam a quest\u00e3o dos animais utilizados na ind\u00fastria da moda e no entretenimento.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-74b7-bc06-7479188dd55f","description":"PETA","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7339-957c-6bbd33431ed8","description":"WWF","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7490-8cf3-adeece93f948","description":"Greenpeace","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7309-b20f-63e9fb8514f9","description":"The Humane Society","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7cd8-a1dd-56327deb3738","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Na mitologia eg\u00edpcia, quem era a m\u00e3e de H\u00f3rus?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u00cdsis tamb\u00e9m era irm\u00e3 de Os\u00edris; depois que ele foi morto por Set, ela protegeu o filho deles enquanto ele crescia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-753d-a678-dc7a04b31476","description":"\u00cdsis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7480-8dbb-c262cd63adec","description":"Set","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-742d-8766-e5289e336fa8","description":"Ammit","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7db4-a638-45ca164b3e4e","description":"Horus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-7acb-9aa2-e3da04c8e324","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"A l\u00edngua \u201cromeno\u201d pertence a qual fam\u00edlia lingu\u00edstica?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O romeno \u00e9 uma l\u00edngua rom\u00e2nica derivada do latim, o que a situa na fam\u00edlia indo-europeia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af4f-724f-a25c-a